#: src/ui/dialogs.rs:46
msgid ""
"You're signed in through the shared app Spotifast used before. Spotifast no "
"longer offers it, and Spotify can stop accepting it at any time. Set up your "
"own free Spotify app so nothing stops your music. It takes a few minutes."
